{"ID":"20240118144949-lk1ocr6","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118144949-lk1ocr6","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144949-lk1ocr6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144949-spyopsq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240204171824-v46jx09\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240204171824-v46jx09\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"384补27小麦","type":"doc","updated":"20240204171824"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118144949-spyopsq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118144949-spyopsq","updated":"20240122171134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"——养心除烦，利溲止血。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171138-9aptkji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171138-9aptkji"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，北方者为良。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171139-bdu08gs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171139-bdu08gs"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘，性平，微寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171141-m54h69t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171141-m54h69t"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】小麦主除客热，养心气，为服食滋养之品。[1.甘草、小麦、红枣汤治女人阴道干。]"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171147-gfnga4o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171147-gfnga4o"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】主除客热，止烦渴咽燥，利小便，养肝气，止漏血唾血，令女子易孕。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171149-shp4jio","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171149-shp4jio"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【思邈】养心气，心病宜食之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171151-wtdcjug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171151-wtdcjug"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【宗奭】煎汤饮治暴淋。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171152-kek91ay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171152-kek91ay"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【素问】麦属火，心之谷也。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171153-w0qwzah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171153-w0qwzah"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【圣惠方】小麦饭治疗烦热少睡多渴。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171154-ow4ezuf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171154-ow4ezuf"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通二至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171156-cj5k7px","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171156-cj5k7px","updated":"20240204171619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】脾虚作胀者，不甚相宜，入药，宜完用，皮肉不可分拆，拆则性温，明面不能消热止烦也。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171158-kax4p00","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171158-kax4p00"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【附录】浮小麦——麦之性轻，入水浮起者，味咸性寒无毒，主益气除烦。治盗汗自汗，骨蒸虚热，妇人劳热。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171204-8rvhxrk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171204-8rvhxrk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"麦苗——味辛性寒，主消酒毒，暴热，酒疸目黄，并捣汁日饮。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171159-dt03sve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171159-dt03sve"}},{"ID":"20240122171159-fwxk9aa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171159-fwxk9aa"}},{"ID":"20240122171200-qqh32eu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171200-qqh32eu","updated":"20240204171454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"27，小麦，养心除烦，利小便，能够止血。平常，北方人用麦来做东西吃，这是食补，吃食物里面的麦类，【主治】除了除客热，养心气，小麦还可以养肝气。"}]},{"ID":"20240122171209-rafwhrd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171209-rafwhrd","updated":"20240204171822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"张仲景在用小麦的时候，甘麦大枣汤，在用小麦，专门用在女人哦，那个如见神灵，常常看到妖魔鬼怪，床旁边站个人，晚上深更半夜，床旁边站个人，如见神明状，还有妇人流泪，那边开party，,生日，大家心情很好啊，几代同堂，大家都很开心，在那边吃东西聊天，她也很开心，一边开心，一边在流眼泪。那为什么开心，眼泪还一直不断在流？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这时候要用小麦，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"因为她子宫，阴道里面整个是干的，津液下不去，从眼睛回逆出来。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以女人没有事情在那边流眼泪，你坐在那边看梁山伯与祝英台流眼泪也就罢了，平常看喜剧也流眼泪，这是就要用到甘麦大枣汤，就会使用到小麦，因为它能养心除烦，能够补足一个人的津液。这个很好玩哦，甘草，红枣，小麦，吃下去，女人阴道的津液就回来了，就不哭了，我们治了很多，你看【圣惠方】里面，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小麦饭，用专门的小麦来吃，小麦做饭，治疗烦热，少睡，多渴，心情烦躁，口渴。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【禁忌】脾虚作胀者，不甚相宜，脾虚，脾脏不足的时候，肚子肿起来，像肝有问题的时候，肝病的人，肚子肿胀，就是脾有问题。脾虚作胀那就比较不好，那至于麦苗呢，你们平常在夜市可以看到倒着一杯绿色的在那边喝，解酒啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240204171824-v46jx09","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204171824-v46jx09"}}]}